---
description: CodeSquad starter conventions (Express + React, plain JS)
globs: ["server/**/*.js", "client/src/**/*.{js,jsx}"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md at the repo root. Highlights:

- Plain JavaScript (ES modules). No TypeScript.
- Server files start with `import 'dotenv/config';`
- zod `safeParse` on every request before DB or AI calls.
- Secrets only in server/.env — never in client code.
- Keep and add teaching comments.
- Multi-provider AI calls use `Promise.allSettled()`.
